  - question: Will I need to take tablets for life?
    answer: >-
      Most people with an underactive thyroid need to take levothyroxine for
      the rest of their life. Once your dose is right, you will usually only
      need a blood test once a year.
  - question: Can an underactive thyroid cause weight gain?
    answer: >-
      It can cause some weight gain, often from fluid. Once treatment brings
      your hormone levels back to normal, some of this weight may come off,
      but levothyroxine is not a weight loss treatment.
